export anchor DarkMarbleStyle:
    number: 257
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark marble
    idea: A hushed luxury studio where the whole canvas is a slab of black marble with gold and grey veins, and the layers and inspector float on it as polished stone cards edged in a single gold line.
    base: dark
    palette:
        onyx: #0c0c0d, the page, top bar and status band
        slab: #151516, floating cards and the style sheet
        slabLight: #1c1c1e, avatar discs
        hairline: #2a2a2c, rules between rows and sections
        vein: #3a3a3d, field underlines and the secondary button edge
        ink: #efece6, text
        stoneGrey: #a8a39a, meta, labels and status
        champagne: #e9dcc0, Didone titles and values
        gold: #cfae6b, card edges, Share, handles, the selected layer edge, veins and focus
        goldWash: #252119, the selected layer row
        roseGold: #a94e37, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        Titles and values in a Didone stack, Didot, Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT,
        Hoefler Text, Georgia. Text in Avenir Next, Avenir, Segoe UI, system-
        ui. Card titles are 21px 400 Didone, the file 20px, field values 17px
        Didone with tabular lining figures, layer names 14px 500, sub lines
        12px italic Didone, and labels 10 to 11px caps tracked 0.2 to 0.32em.
    layout:
        A slim onyx top bar in three parts. Left is a gold spaced caps
        Brightwork Canvas over Website redesign and an italic Home v3. Centre
        is the six bare tool icons with Move lit and underlined by a glowing
        gold line, then 66% in Didone. Right holds gold ringed avatars, an
        outlined pill Present and a gold pill Share. Below, the stage is black
        marble with thin gold and grey vein curves drawn across it. On it
        float three columns, a 262px layers card, the frame in the middle and
        a 282px inspector card, both cards polished slabs with a 1px gold edge
        and a deep shadow. The layers card lists gold kind icons with names
        and italic sub lines, Hero washed in gold with a gold edge and a
        Selected tag in spaced caps. The white Hero frame has a gold outline
        and round gold ringed handles, with a status band of spaced caps under
        it. The inspector uses italic Didone section names, Position, Fill
        with a ringed white swatch, Auto layout with Vertical, Corner radius
        and Export, and underline only fields with large Didone values. Below
        860px cards stack under the frame and the tools become a fixed bottom
        bar.
    spacing: An 8px unit used generously. 32px between floating cards, 20px card padding, 10px layer rows.
    density: Airy. Few lines per card with wide marble gutters.
    corners: 2px stone cards, round handles and avatars, full pill buttons.
    borders: One 1px gold edge at 55 percent on each card, hairline rules inside, fields as underlines only.
    shadows: Deep and soft, 0 30px 60px black at 70 percent under cards and 0 40px 80px under the frame.
    icons:
        Fine line icons at 1.2px stroke, 17px, in gold. Selected is a circled
        check, Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check, always
        with the word.
    focus: A 1px gold outline offset 3px with a 4px gold glow ring.
    tone: Reserved and elegant, Didone titles with spaced caps labels such as Position and Export.
